t","value":"Depending on what you need, you might also look for extra skills, like being a strong public speaker or having experience with certain technologies.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"heading-3","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Step 3: Setting a Competitive Compensation Package","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"This can be tricky. How do you create a compensation package thatâ€™s attractive, fair to the rest of the team, and doesnâ€™t stretch your budget too thin?","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"You likely already have standard policies and benefits in place, and developing a unique package just for one new employee doesnâ€™t seem practical ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"(nor fair to existing employees)","marks":[{"type":"italic"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":".Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"At the same time, youâ€™re hiring for a management role, which carries more responsibilities and has a bigger impact on your businessâ€”and the pay and benefits should reflect that.Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Here are a few ideas for how to strike the balance:","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"1. Research the market if you havenâ€™t done it yet. ","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"Check salary surveys, job boards, and industry reports to see what other companies are offering for similar roles.Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"2. Understand the roleâ€™s impact. ","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"The sales managerâ€™s compensation should reflect the level of responsibility theyâ€™ll have and the impact theyâ€™re expected to make on your business.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"3. Choose the compensation type. ","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"The base salary is usually just the starting point for a sales manager's compensation. Here are the most common models:","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"unordered-list","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Base salary + commission from sales/profits","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Base salary + bonus compensation for hitting targets","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Commission-based compensation","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Any type of compensation + equity","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]}]},{"nodeType":"embedded-asset-block","data":{"target":{"metadata":{"tags":[],"concepts":[]},"sys":{"space":{"sys":{"type":"Link","linkType":"Space","id":"kyprwggh4muz"}},"id":"6Qa4fUbgKdM5s60vj5n6v8","type":"Asset","createdAt":"2024-09-26T21:16:38.677Z","updatedAt":"2024-09-26T21:16:38.677Z","environment":{"sys":{"id":"master","type":"Link","linkType":"Environment"}},"publishedVersion":5,"revision":1,"locale":"en-US"},"fields":{"title":"TABLE","description":"A table with the following text:\nCompensation Model\nBase Salary\nVariable Compensation\nTotal Compensation\nBase Salary + Commission \n$70,000\n5% of $1,000,000 = $50,000\n$120,000\nBase Salary + Bonus \n$70,000\n$10,000\n$80,000\nCommission-Based Compensation\n$0\n10% of $1,000,000 = $100,000\n$100,000\nBase Salary + Equity\n$70,000\nEquity worth $20,000\n$90,000\n\n","file":{"url":"//images.ctfassets.net/kyprwggh4muz/6Qa4fUbgKdM5s60vj5n6v8/161551232561ead11f4f227ff7954efb/TABLE.webp","details":{"size":166134,"image":{"width":2401,"height":815}},"fileName":"TABLE.webp","contentType":"image/webp"}}}},"content":[]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"4. Create a fair and transparent benefits package. ","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"While you may not be able to offer perks like a shorter workweek or unique benefits not shared by the rest of the team, introducing a performance-based benefits system for a management role is a fair approach. For example, you could offer additional insurance coverage after the sales manager has been with the company for a certain period or has achieved specific results.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"5. Set clear expectations for performance evaluation. ","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"Be upfront about how youâ€™ll measure your new hireâ€™s success. Outline the ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"hyperlink","data":{"uri":"https://www.artisan.co/blog/b2b-sales-kpis"},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"key performance indicators (KPIs)","marks":[{"type":"underline"}],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"text","value":" that will be used to assess their performance and ensure they align with the candidate's expertise.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"6.Â  Map out a clear career advancement path. ","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"Show candidates how they can grow within the company. Define specific milestones they need to achieve, outline an expected timeline for these milestones, and perhaps even set a regular schedule for performance and compensation reviews.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"heading-3","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Step 4: Writing a Sales Manager Job Description That Stands Out","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"A great job description needs two things:","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":" the candidateâ€™s requirements and what you, as an employer, offer.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Start by building on your existing draft of core responsibilities.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Be specific about what the sales manager will do on a daily basis and provide real examples. Instead of a vague line like ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"â€œImprove the teamâ€™s sales performance,â€","marks":[{"type":"italic"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":" try something more detailed, such as ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"â€œUse your expertise in workflow automation to overhaul the companyâ€™s lead qualification and scoring system.â€","marks":[{"type":"italic"}],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Keep it precise and practicalâ€”","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"cut out the fluff and focus on what the role truly involves. ","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"For instance, this job ad by Shopify makes it very clear what the day-to-day activities of their future sales manager will look like:Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Secondly, to attract top talent, your job description needs to be more than just a list of requirements. ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"Why would a great sales manager want to work with you? What sets your company apart?","marks":[{"type":"italic"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Besides mentioning the perks and benefits of the role, ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"explain what makes your company a great place to work","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":". Mention unique aspects of your workplace culture, opportunities for growth, and any other incentives that make the position stand out.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"We've reviewed over 50 job ads for sales managers, and only two provided a clear list of benefitsâ€”","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"beyond the usual \"youâ€™ll get to work with the best team on earth.\"","marks":[{"type":"italic"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":" This is an example of one that did it right:","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"blockquote","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"ðŸ’¡ Add consistent processes to the list of your competitive advantages. With Ava, your sales reps wonâ€™t get stuck in ineffective manual workflows, which every sales manager will appreciate. ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"hyperlink","data":{"uri":"https://www.artisan.co/ai-sales-agent"},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Hire Ava","marks":[{"type":"underline"}],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"text","value":" to improve your sales workflows today.Â Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"heading-3","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Step 5: Finding Qualified Sales Manager Candidates","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"When ready, publish your job ad across job boards like Indeed, Glassdoor, and LinkedIn. If you have a strong online presence, post on your companyâ€™s career website and social media profiles, too.Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"But donâ€™t just sit back and wait for candidates to come to you. ","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"According to Employ's ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"hyperlink","data":{"uri":"https://pages.lever.co/Lever-2025-Job-Seeker-Nation-Report.html"},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"2025 Job Seeker Nation ","marks":[{"type":"italic"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"report","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"text","value":", 85% of workers are at least somewhat open to new opportunities. You can massively increase your potential candidate pool by being proactive. ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Hereâ€™s how you can tap into that pool:","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"unordered-list","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Use LinkedIn to find and engage with potential candidates.","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":" Look for those who are active in industry-specific groups or who regularly share insights about sales strategies.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Attend industry meetups. ","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"These are excellent places to scout top talent in person.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Promote from within.","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":" Encourage your current employees to refer qualified candidates from their networks.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Offer a referral bonus.","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":" Announce compensation for recommending a candidate who joins your team.Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"\nAgain, donâ€™t limit your candidate pool to those with the \"open to work\" badge on their LinkedIn profiles. Reach out to people who match your criteria proactively.Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"heading-3","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Step 6: Screening and Shortlisting Candidates","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"The screening process can quickly become overwhelming. Do yourself a favor and make it easier by including clear instructions in your job description.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Right, letâ€™s get a few steps back.","marks":[{"type":"italic"}],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"In your application form, ask for:Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"unordered-list","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"A resume that highlights specific achievements and experiences.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"A cover letter that explains how their background aligns with the role.Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"A proven track record of past successes.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Professional references or recommendation letters to validate their qualifications.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"\nFinally, double-check all the must-have requirements, like relocation readiness or language proficiency. Adding a few simple yes/no questions to the application form will save you a lot of time during the screening process.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"embedded-asset-block","data":{"target":{"metadata":{"tags":[],"concepts":[]},"sys":{"space":{"sys":{"type":"Link","linkType":"Space","id":"kyprwggh4muz"}},"id":"62DTH8hqvglF6QPuAlQQLI","type":"Asset","createdAt":"2024-09-26T21:19:02.483Z","updatedAt":"2024-09-26T21:19:02.483Z","environment":{"sys":{"id":"master","type":"Link","linkType":"Environment"}},"publishedVersion":7,"revision":1,"locale":"en-US"},"fields":{"title":"Job posting checkbox ","description":"A job posting questionnaire asking information about a candidate's location and whether they'd be able to relocate. ","file":{"url":"//images.ctfassets.net/kyprwggh4muz/62DTH8hqvglF6QPuAlQQLI/fc26c5034cade65b6df960e464bf4a0e/Screen_Shot_2024-09-26_at_2.17.28_PM.png","details":{"size":140662,"image":{"width":1528,"height":784}},"fileName":"Screen Shot 2024-09-26 at 2.17.28 PM.png","contentType":"image/png"}}}},"content":[]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"So, youâ€™ve got your applicationsâ€”what now?","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"If youâ€™re dealing with a handful of applications, youâ€™ll manage well with a manual review. However, if you have to sift through loads of candidates, an automation tool like Lever or TestGorilla will be of huge help.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"These ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"hyperlink","data":{"uri":"https://www.artisan.co/blog/how-to-recruit-sales-reps"},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"candidate screening tools","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"text","value":" can:","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"unordered-list","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Filter out candidates who donâ€™t meet your basic criteria.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Highlight the most promising candidates.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Test shortlisted candidates on various skills.\n","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"blockquote","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Pro tip: ","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"Â Use ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"hyperlink","data":{"uri":"https://www.testgorilla.com/test-library/"},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"talent assessments","marks":[{"type":"underline"}],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"text","value":" as an additional screening step before the interview. These short tests can help you evaluate various factors, such as cognitive abilities, problem-solving skills, team management capabilities, and even specific sales-related skills like proficiency with certain software.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Based on your initial screening, narrow down the list to candidates who appear to be a strong fit. Notify them that theyâ€™ve been shortlisted and invite them to schedule a first-round interview.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"heading-3","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Step 7: Preparing Sales Manager Interview Questions","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"There are at least four types of questions you should cover in your interviews. Letâ€™s quickly walk you through each.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"1. Personality assessment questions ","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"help gauge a candidateâ€™s personality traits and how they align with your team and company culture:","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"unordered-list","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"â€œHow would your colleagues describe your leadership style?â€","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"â€œWhat motivates you in your role as a sales manager?â€","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"â€œDescribe a situation where you had to adjust your communication style to work effectively with a diverse team.â€","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"â€œWhat are your key strengths and weaknesses as a leader?â€","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"â€œHow do you maintain a work-life balance and manage stress?â€","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"\t","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"2. Qualification-based questions","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":" mainly help to verify a candidate's CV credentials:","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"unordered-list","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"â€œWhat specific sales management certifications or sales training have you completed?â€","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"â€œCan you provide examples of sales campaigns or projects youâ€™ve led and their outcomes?â€","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"â€œHow many years of experience do you have managing sales teams, and in what industries?â€","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"â€œWhatâ€™s the largest sales team youâ€™ve managed?â€","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"â€œDescribe a major sales challenge youâ€™ve faced and how your qualifications helped you overcome it.â€","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"3. Competency questions ","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"focus on specific skills and knowledge relevant to the sales manager role:","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"unordered-list","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"â€œCan you walk us through your process for developing a successful sales strategy?â€","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"â€œWhat metrics do you use to evaluate sales performance, and how do you act on them?â€","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"â€œHow do you approach forecasting and setting sales targets?â€","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"â€œDescribe your experience with implementing new CRM systems or sales technologies.â€","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"â€œWhat techniques do you use to coach and develop salespeople?â€","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"4. Behavioral questions","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":" explore the candidateâ€™s approach to problem-solving:","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"unordered-list","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"â€œTell me about a time when you had to manage a conflict within your sales team. What was the result?â€","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"â€œDescribe a situation where you had to meet a tight sales deadline. How did you ensure your team stayed on track?â€","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"â€œImagine our company is launching a new product in a highly competitive market. What would be your strategy to gain market share?â€","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"â€œHow have you handled a situation where your sales representatives werenâ€™t meeting its targets?â€","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"â€œIf you had to choose between improving sales performance by 10% or reducing sales team turnover by 20%, which would you prioritize and why?â€","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"There are other types of questions, like brainteasers, that you could use later on. For first-round interviews, though, the questions listed above hit the mark perfectly.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"heading-3","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Step 8: Conduct the Interview","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Youâ€™re hiring for a sales manager position, so your ideal candidate should be quite comfortable with meeting new peopleâ€”","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"after all, they must have run hundreds of meetings and calls. ","marks":[{"type":"italic"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"But itâ€™s still important to create a positive atmosphere and reduce tension from the beginning. An interview that feels like a test wonâ€™t benefit either of you.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"After a friendly introduction, let a candidate know what to expect during the interview. Give them a quick rundown of the structure so both of you are on the same page.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Youâ€™ve got your list of questionsâ€”stick to it. Asking everyone the same questions will allow you to fairly compare and score candidates later.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"And remember, while youâ€™re looking for the ideal candidate for your team, theyâ€™re looking for the ideal place of work. When youâ€™re done interviewing them, give them a chance to interview you.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"heading-3","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Step 9: Assess Candidates Post-Interview","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Donâ€™t think youâ€™ll cover everything you need in a single interview. A typical hiring process takes at least 2-3 rounds or more depending on the number of stakeholders involved.Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"To decide who should move on to the next stage, review your interview notes and score each candidate based on how well they align with your requirements. Compare candidates based on key criteria such as sales leadership, experience, and cultural fit.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Youâ€™ll hardly find a candidate who checks ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"all","marks":[{"type":"italic"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":" the boxes. So youâ€™ll need to prioritize your criteria and decide where youâ€™re flexible. For example, you may find someone with all the skills you need but who is asking for more compensation than you budgeted. Prioritizing factors like salary expectations, qualifications, and soft skills will help you determine if itâ€™s worth adjusting your offer or if you should consider candidates with slightly less experience.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"As a final touch, run reference checks with their previous employers. Ask questions like:","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"unordered-list","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"â€œCan you describe the candidateâ€™s leadership style and how they managed their team?â€","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"â€œHow did the candidate handle challenges or conflicts in their previous role?â€","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"â€œWhat were their key strengths and areas for improvement?â€","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"â€œHow would you describe their work ethic and reliability?â€","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"â€œWould you rehire this candidate? Why or why not?â€","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Youâ€™ll assess, shortlist, interview, and so on in a circle until you have one ideal candidate youâ€™re ready to make an offer to.Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"heading-3","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Step 10: Make the Final Hiring Decision","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Youâ€™ve found the oneâ€”the perfect candidate for your team. Now, how do you seal the deal?","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Send them an email with an official job offer. This should include the salary, benefits, and expected start date (which youâ€™ve likely already discussed with each candidate during the interviews). Once sent, the ball is in their court.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"embedded-asset-block","data":{"target":{"metadata":{"tags":[],"concepts":[]},"sys":{"space":{"sys":{"type":"Link","linkType":"Space","id":"kyprwggh4muz"}},"id":"6gM6PVjt5ovbQZxQ7mucgs","type":"Asset","createdAt":"2024-09-26T21:20:40.485Z","updatedAt":"2024-09-26T21:20:40.485Z","environment":{"sys":{"id":"master","type":"Link","linkType":"Environment"}},"publishedVersion":5,"revision":1,"locale":"en-US"},"fields":{"title":"EMAIL (1)","description":"A screenshot of an email offering a candidate a job as Sales Manager. ","file":{"url":"//images.ctfassets.net/kyprwggh4muz/6gM6PVjt5ovbQZxQ7mucgs/f7f2eaefbc42c6c9236989bc296d717d/EMAIL__1_.webp","details":{"size":299464,"image":{"width":1958,"height":1448}},"fileName":"EMAIL (1).webp","contentType":"image/webp"}}}},"content":[]},{"nodeType":"blockquote","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Hard truth: ","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"Â Even if youâ€™re sold on your ideal candidate, they might not feel the same way. A lot of people apply for positions just to explore their options or leverage the offer to get a better deal at their current job. So, have a backup plan with a few other candidates in mind, just in case your top pick turns you down.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"embedded-asset-block","data":{"target":{"metadata":{"tags":[],"concepts":[]},"sys":{"space":{"sys":{"type":"Link","linkType":"Space","id":"kyprwggh4muz"}},"id":"1ZAXxNiV0ZPOWHaf9rzTT7","type":"Asset","createdAt":"2024-09-26T21:22:42.183Z","updatedAt":"2024-09-26T21:22:42.183Z","environment":{"sys":{"id":"master","type":"Link","linkType":"Environment"}},"publishedVersion":11,"revision":1,"locale":"en-US"},"fields":{"title":"Reddit Post ","description":"A sc